Attribution
-----------
This work is an adaptation of "Java Programming" (https://java-programming.mooc.fi/)
by the Agile Education Research Group, University of Helsinki (MOOC.fi), licensed
under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0. The course text has been rewritten for C++23 and the exercises
have been translated from Java to C++.

Third-party material in the exercise folders:
  - exercises/part10/10_13_LiteracyComparison/literacy.csv: UNESCO Institute for Statistics data
  - exercises/part14/14_05_CyclingStatistics/cycling-monthly.csv: derived from City of Helsinki open data
  - exercises/part14/14_07_Collage/monalisa.png: public domain
  - exercises/part14/14_08_Hurray/Applause-Yannick_Lemieux.wav: Yannick Lemieux, CC BY 3.0
